+		/*
+		 * Compatibility patch for iOS 14.3 userland on iOS 16 kernel.
+		 * The launchd from iOS 14.3 uses option flags on the bootstrap port
+		 * that the iOS 16 kernel's ipc_kmsg_option_check rejects, triggering
+		 * kGUARD_EXC_INVALID_OPTIONS (mach_port_guard_exception) which kills
+		 * pid 1.  To allow boot progression, we skip the strict option validation
+		 * that would otherwise cause the guard exception.  Deeper compatibility
+		 * walls (vnguard, AMFI, launchd_cache_loader vs libignition, etc.) remain
+		 * and will need separate patches after this one.
